OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds sign MP's emergency care
OL,4,Aupgrade letter
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of residents have signed an
OL,7,FMP's open letter calling on NHS bosses
OL,8,Fto provide doctor-led urgent care in a
OL,9,Ftown's hospital.
OL,11,FRugby MP John Slinger is campaigning
OL,12,Ffor an upgrade to the current nurse-led
OL,13,FUrgent Treatment Centre (UTC) at the
OL,14,FHospital of St Cross due to population
OL,15,Fgrowth and pressure on nearby A&E
OL,16,Fdepartments.
OL,18,FHe told constituents: "Following my
OL,19,Fmeeting with the Integrated Care Board
OL,20,F(ICB) last week, I'm now asking the NHS
OL,21,Fto deliver it."
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
